msgstr "Prijzen en valuta"

#. Booster 8.5 provenance: reviewed_accept
#: includes/admin/wcj-welcome-screen-content.php:113
msgid "Make it easy for customers around the globe to make purchases on your site by displaying their currency with the Prices and Currencies by Country module."
msgstr "Maak aankopen eenvoudiger voor klanten wereldwijd door hun valuta weer te geven met de module Prijzen en valuta per land."

#. Booster 8.5 provenance: reviewed_accept
#: includes/admin/wcj-welcome-screen-content.php:122
